{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1474","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Different Divisors"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Positive integer $$$x$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"divisor"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of positive integer $$$y$$$, if $$$y$$$ is divisible by $$$x$$$ without remainder. For example, $$$1$$$ is a divisor of $$$7$$$ and $$$3$$$ is not divisor of $$$8$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We gave you an integer $$$d$$$ and asked you to find "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"the smallest"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" positive integer $$$a$$$, such that "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a$$$ has at least $$$4$$$ divisors; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" difference between any two divisors of $$$a$$$ is at least $$$d$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 3000$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$d$$$ ($$$1 \\leq d \\leq 10000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case print one integer $$$a$$$ — the answer for this test case."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n15\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, integer $$$6$$$ have following divisors: $$$[1, 2, 3, 6]$$$. There are $$$4$$$ of them and the difference between any two of them is at least $$$1$$$. There is no smaller integer with at least $$$4$$$ divisors."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, integer $$$15$$$ have following divisors: $$$[1, 3, 5, 15]$$$. There are $$$4$$$ of them and the difference between any two of them is at least $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The answer $$$12$$$ is INVALID because divisors are $$$[1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 12]$$$. And the difference between, for example, divisors $$$2$$$ and $$$3$$$ is less than $$$d=2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1474B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1474/problem/B"}